		(descr "Seeed XIAO ESP32C6 (21 x 17.8 mm) on two 1x7 2.54 mm female headers, 15.24 mm row spacing. Pins anticlockwise from the USB end (Seeed pin map): 1-7 = D0-D6 down the left, 8-14 = D7, D8, D9, D10, 3V3, GND, 5V up the right; USB end towards -Y. EN is a bottom pad, unreachable through headers.")
